  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize the Aces. Since you only have 32 cards, missing one Ace early usually leads to an immediate 'deadlock' (block).\n\nStock Management: Don't fill every empty tableau spot immediately if you have many cards left in the stock. Sometimes it's better to wait for a 7 or an 8 to appear to maintain a clean layout.\n\nThe 'Seven Block': In a 32-card deck, the 7 is the base. If a 7 is buried under a higher-value card in the stock, you must find a way to clear the tableau to cycle through the stock effectively.",
    Player: "Prioritize the Aces. Since you only have 32 cards, missing one Ace early usually leads to an immediate 'deadlock' (block).\n\nStock Management: Don't fill every empty tableau spot immediately if you have many cards left in the stock. Sometimes it's better to wait for a 7 or an 8 to appear to maintain a clean layout.\n\nThe 'Seven Block': In a 32-card deck, the 7 is the base. If a 7 is buried under a higher-value card in the stock, you must find a way to clear the tableau to cycle through the stock effectively.",
