    intermediate: "Stock Management: Don't fill every empty tableau spot immediately if you have many cards left in the stock. Sometimes it's better to wait for a 7 or an 8 to appear to maintain a clean layout.",
    advanced: "The 'Seven Block': In a 32-card deck, the 7 is the base. If a 7 is buried under a higher-value card in the stock, you must find a way to clear the tableau to cycle through the stock effectively.",
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'Concentrate on one suit at a time if the cards allow. Since there are fewer cards per suit (8), completing one foundation pile early significantly opens up the table.',
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "If you reach the end of the stock and haven't placed all 32 cards, you lose the round.",
